  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><h1 data-lake-id=\"v1Mrw\" id=\"v1Mrw\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua3c92fc7\" id=\"ua3c92fc7\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">param参数</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u1879e9c5\" id=\"u1879e9c5\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubf7f081c\" id=\"ubf7f081c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">参数是节点的配置值。您可以将参数视为节点设置。节点可以将参数存储为整数、浮点数、布尔值、字符串和列表。在 ROS 2 中，每个节点都维护自己的参数。</span></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"rl190\" id=\"rl190\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2868cdb7\" id=\"u2868cdb7\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">param参数命令</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"udc8099d4\" id=\"udc8099d4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u65d337cb\" id=\"u65d337cb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">参数列表:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22ros2%20param%20list%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22J3GGm%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u4224b35e\" id=\"u4224b35e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u508e3b70\" id=\"u508e3b70\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">获取参数值:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22ros2%20param%20get%20%3Cnode_name%3E%20%3Cparameter_name%3E%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22